diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 7ca7ac6..cd8c4f5 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 ## Unreleased
 
 - `clinic handover` prints the evening note for the next open day.
+- Fixed: phone numbers typed with spaces, like `07700 900123`, were refused; spaces are now dropped. The error shows the number as typed.
 - New `max_daily_bookings` setting, default 2: one phone number cannot hold more bookings than that on one day.
 - The bookings file is written in booking reference order, so new bookings land at the bottom.
 - Cancellations with less than `cancellation_notice_hours` (default 24) to go are recorded as `late_cancelled`.
